I have found a chosen group of unique individuals for an evening gathering. I have narrowed my options to Willow Shield, half human, half Jinn and escapee from a forbidden ancestral vineyard, a prominent landowner in Ephesos, and the fifth-century Hamilton S. Haney - an immense influence in shared global perceptions of cultural conservation.

Mindfulness is the foundational principle of this coming together. Willow discovered this power of balance with her father, a man of the Amazons and Christian Disciple. This was how Willow created the first portal technology for her community and re-discovered the ancient map of the lost Banyan tree.

Based on this discovery, the rules at this dinner party must include distraction! Only one attendee may speak at a time, and each story must be told in a different tone or voice (e.g. my story is told in a whisper, your story is told in a loud shout).

